# Demo Rule — Apply Intelligently (Planning Mode)

When the user prompt is about *planning* the demo project (structure, data flow, interactions), follow this response pattern:

## Response template
- PLAN
  - File responsibilities
  - Data flow (JSON → JS → UI)
  - Interaction flow
- TODO LIST
  - 10–15 concrete, ordered steps
- QUESTIONS
  - Ask only what is truly ambiguous

## Guardrail
- Do not write or generate project code until the user explicitly confirms.
